# Page Format

A .vn page is plain text. Check readme for the whole syntax.

## Links

Written as label, pipe, path, in square brackets. These three are real:

[About|about.vn]
> a page in pages_dir, by filename

[BBS Main|b]
> b is the boards, b/name is one board, b/name/12 is a thread

[BBS General|b/general]
> a link is only a link if the whole line is one

## Directives 

(Note: Remove _ for functioning directives)

!c cyan
The directive !_c <colour> applies to the lines after it, until the next !_c
!c

!_allow KEY restricts a page to listed keys. Stripped before sending, 6-byte pKey is used

Anything else is a paragraph. A malformed line renders as plain text.

[Back|index.vn]
